.TH THUMTOO-BENCH 1 "2026-09-16" "thumtoo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thumtoo-bench \- cold-cache phase timing for thumtoo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thumtoo-bench
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
\fIPATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Benchmark thumtoo cold-cache phases on files or archives. Each phase uses a
fresh stats window; overall wall time is also reported. Default cache root is
under
.B thumtoo-bench
and is wiped each run.
.PP
Typical phases: size probe, optional soft ladder, optional tile pyramid or
single-cell request. See
.B \-\-help
for options (
.BR \-\-jobs ,
.BR \-\-ladder ,
.BR \-\-tiles ,
.BR \-\-tile\-cell ,
\&...).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1),
.BR thumtoo-status (1)
